      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<h2>Small things</h2><ul><li>The count pill on unfinished dictionaries is a touch taller, with a hairline edge; the gray option is quieter.</li><li>The checkmark now pops in and the pill slides over to make room.</li></ul>]]></description>
