    <item>
      <title>WTF 0.11.1</title>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 16:46:33 -0700</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>15</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.11.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<h2>Polish</h2><ul><li><b>Everything in SF Rounded</b> — titles, settings, lists, not just the words.</li><li><b>Siri answers to more phrasings</b>, including &quot;Spell with Whiskey Tango Foxtrot&quot;.</li><li><b>Unfinished dictionaries</b> show a count pill; pick its color under Settings › Draft color.</li><li>Symbol keycaps (space, @) are easier to read; the New… menu is tidier.</li></ul>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/newforms/wtf-releases/releases/download/v0.11.1/WTF-0.11.1.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="RowgJXcG8MeK/9LERrPuMqZ8s5iMQWdaJcXtj2+FXRDMQ1Eb38MZPUtLwO6iHEnQdXdwNP8KClEsYYn4lEvZCg==" length="3322622"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>WTF 0.11.0</title>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 14:09:03 -0700</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>14</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.11.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<h2>Ask Siri</h2><ul><li><b>&quot;Hey Siri, spell with WTF&quot;</b> — Siri asks what, then <i>says</i> the spelling (&quot;T as in Tango, I as in India…&quot;) and shows the rows, with an Open in WTF button. Also from Spotlight and Shortcuts.</li><li><b><code>wtf://spell?text=…</code></b> opens WTF with the text in the field.</li><li>Settings › Dictionaries now says &quot;Custom Dictionaries — Show in Finder&quot;.</li></ul>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/newforms/wtf-releases/releases/download/v0.11.0/WTF-0.11.0.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="ySG7RvkjqT+LwmMQFbMxvhYQXYDkzs5NfCQYU9Hk0T3sq8r7GCHlnJjRYqk0NK6nnjCEM8Gd0Fk+2ZtRWXUQDw==" length="3307443"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>WTF 0.10.0</title>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 11:23:45 -0700</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>13</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.10.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<h2>Your own dictionaries</h2><ul><li><b>Make a dictionary</b> — Settings › Dictionaries › New…, from scratch or as a copy of any built-in. Type a word per letter; it saves as you go.</li><li><b>Lives in iCloud Drive</b> — each dictionary is a small JSON file in <i>iCloud Drive › WTF › Dictionaries</i>. Edit it in any text editor, and it shows up on your iPhone too.</li><li><b>Missing letters</b> show a faded <i>Empty</i> until you fill them in; the picker shows how many are done.</li><li><b>Dictionary choice is now per device</b> — the Mac can stay on NATO while the phone shows off the silly one.</li></ul>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/newforms/wtf-releases/releases/download/v0.10.0/WTF-0.10.0.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="+NlDP+t5EAJlBpbwqWMtl/t+nXG6y6a3C+j/pPVGiDlG+Q/hTxiFCmK+rjuzNBymquX5QatQ0+omQk1ICHNqDA==" length="3268040"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>WTF 0.9.1</title>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 02:01:27 -0700</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>12</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.9.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<h2>Keycaps, refined</h2><ul><li><b>Space and symbol rows</b> now use the same key, legend and word styling as letters, faded to 20% — they read as filler, not as a different kind of thing.</li><li><b>Letter keys</b> get a hairline of light along the top edge and shade along the bottom, plus a soft drop shadow that deepens in dark mode.</li></ul>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/newforms/wtf-releases/releases/download/v0.9.1/WTF-0.9.1.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="lShHdKOhCwEDrof9sjhgimeCNdgel+aIVCsw0S1HSBC0aaPtwnDcJcGQvlodIPdy8ERO/R8KcWLERyaYr+uoBw==" length="3101233"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>WTF 0.9.0</title>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 01:08:39 -0700</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>11</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.9.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><b>Removing a recent entry — or clearing them all — now reaches your other devices.</b> Before, sync only ever added; now iCloud is the source of truth after the first merge.</p><p><b>Softer input field</b> — 8pt corners to match the keycaps — and a simpler clock icon for recents.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/newforms/wtf-releases/releases/download/v0.9.0/WTF-0.9.0.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="qU9W/qkynpxbdP8aZgm4LCF7vo9r7X5F80GWUAPx7Pvjnf3okdfMELEGXD2Q4kYkHXIYY91qrN5QKVB5eSkcCQ==" length="3097073"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>WTF 0.8.0</title>
      <pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 22:56:41 -0700</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>10</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><b>Your recents and settings now sync through iCloud.</b> Spell something on the iPhone, and it&#x27;s in the Mac&#x27;s recents moments later — and they survive deleting and reinstalling. Nothing to sign in to; it uses the iCloud account you&#x27;re already on. Turn it off in Settings if you&#x27;d rather not.</p><p><b>Type weight</b> on the Mac now matches the iPhone.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/newforms/wtf-releases/releases/download/v0.8.0/WTF-0.8.0.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="OovNtHHlhHQbFXgeppE1DedkXU4g6Gqi4iiRXrueDMN5uZDRL6G4M++KpxyfB7TAFPR40wdd4XBY5Y/2lEWQCQ==" length="3096135"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>WTF 0.7.0</title>
      <pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 17:36:41 -0700</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>9</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.7.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><b>New setting: Repeat first letter in word</b> — choose between <code>W  WHISKEY</code> and <code>W HISKEY</code>, where the keycap <i>is</i> the first letter. Settings → General.</p><p><b>Words are UPPERCASE by default</b> now, with a little more letter-spacing so caps breathe. Title case and lowercase are still there.</p><p><b>Refined keycaps</b> — no outline; a lit top edge and a soft shadow instead, so they read as keys in light and dark mode. Legend and word now share the same size and weight in SF Pro Rounded.</p><p>Same model as the iPhone app, which is on TestFlight.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/newforms/wtf-releases/releases/download/v0.7.0/WTF-0.7.0.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="HeN8H2GuUM3IkyZOIM8SoVtOtGLTLoOBtxFaYX4KP4GLNipPxMMjnS9CCn/jrqs6vG3rKCZirbDDKb9Fc0tSBw==" length="3009541"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>WTF 0.6.0</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 18:58:45 -0700</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>8</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><b>Refined app icon</b> — a more convincing keycap, with the legend sized like a real Magic Keyboard key.<br><br><b>Lighter popover buttons</b> — the settings and quit buttons are now bare, with a subtle circle that appears on hover. Slightly larger icons, more room between them.<br><br><b>Under the hood</b> — the app now runs on the same shared model as the upcoming iPhone version. Your recents and settings carry over unchanged.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/newforms/wtf-releases/releases/download/v0.6.0/WTF-0.6.0.zip" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="lC+n1nmtJ3vukhZbsws6b135CpHPJpCM0x2ClTxQmbfwsXZRn6DQOJWu6g6fxKabuxmy3tqN5IvoLKKpNvrLBQ==" length="3007377"/>
